If you haven't already, check out our newest addition to our Facebook Fan Page, The Global Rhythm Culture Video Channel.  You will find a collection of awesome West African drumming & dancing videos and performances that we have personally selected for your enjoyment.  This is the perfect channel for a friday night in with a cool beverage.  Sit back and enjoy the show! [Global Rhythm Culture Video Channel](https://www.facebook.com/RhythmCultureOZ/app_233050493492319)
